  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-white pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Duplication Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ef/Naruto_Katsuyu_Slug_Great_Division.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220926032452\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Naruto Katsuyu Slug Great Division\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ef/Naruto_Katsuyu_Slug_Great_Division.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20220926032452\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ef/Naruto_Katsuyu_Slug_Great_Division.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20220926032452 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ef/Naruto_Katsuyu_Slug_Great_Division.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220926032452 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Naruto Katsuyu Slug Great Division\" width=\"270\" height=\"203\" data-image-key=\"Naruto_Katsuyu_Slug_Great_Division.gif\" data-image-name=\"Naruto Katsuyu Slug Great Division.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Katsuyu (Naruto)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb one's duplicates.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb one's duplicates and utilize this in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Replication\" title=\"Replication\">Replication</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-Self_Absorption\" title=\"Alternate-Self Absorption\">Alternate-Self Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDuplication_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Clone Absorption/Assimilation</li>\n<li>Duplicate Assimilation</li>\n<li>Multipresence Merging</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDuplication_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb their duplicates or multiple presences back into a single self, and use this in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently. Usually this involves absorbing the memories, skills and experiences of the duplicate. They can also use merging as a form of healing by absorbing an uninjured copy. Usually, users of this ability re-absorb their clones when they are not needed, thus returning to their original self to strength. Duplicate absorption can also be done to save energy or mental capacity by minimizing the effort required to sustain multiple presences.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDuplication_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Absorption\" title=\"Memory Absorption\">Memory Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Experientially_Induced_Powers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Experientially Induced Powers\">Experientially Induced Powers</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Size_Augmentation\" title=\"Size Augmentation\">Size Augmentation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDuplication_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-Self_Absorption\" title=\"Alternate-Self Absorption\">Alternate-Self Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-self_Summoning\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alternate-self Summoning\">Alternate-self Summoning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Assimilation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Biological Assimilation\">Biological Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnireplication\" title=\"Omnireplication\">Omnireplication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Replication\" title=\"Replication\">Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Replication\" title=\"Self-Replication\">Self-Replication</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Singularity\" title=\"Singularity\">Singularity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Temporal_Duplication\" title=\"Temporal Duplication\">Temporal Duplication</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDuplication_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May not be able to absorb dead, injured, or unwilling copies.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDuplication_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Dragons (<i>American Dragon: Jake Long</i>)\n<ul><li>Jake Long</li></ul></li>\n<li>Ditto (<i>Ben 10 Series</i>)</li>\n<li>Echo Echo (<i>Ben 10 Series</i>)</li>\n<li>Slapback (<i>Ben 10 Reboot</i>)</li>\n<li>Penny Lent (<i>Sky High</i>)</li>\n<li>Giant Multi-Headed Dog (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Katsuya (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of&#160;the Shadow Clone technique&#160;(<i>Naruto</i>)\n<ul><li>Naruto Uzumaki (<i>Naruto</i>)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Elizabeth \"Z\" Delgado (<i>Power Rangers S.P.D.</i>)</li>\n<li>James Madrox/Multiple Man (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Wego Twins (<i>Kim Possible</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dannyphantom.fandom.com/wiki/Duplication\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dannyphantom:Duplication\">Duplication</a> Users (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li>Reprise (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Kid Amazo (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Luornu Durgo (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Jaina_Hudson_(Prime_Earth)\">Jaina Hudson/White Rabbit</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Zou_Kang_(New_Earth)\">Zou Kang/Thundermind</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Luke Fon Fabre (<i>Tales of the Abyss</i>)</li>\n<li>Suzaku (<i>Yu Yu Hakusho</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://muchalucha.fandom.com/wiki/Double_Ninja_Ninja\">Double Ninja Ninja</a> (<i>Mucha Lucha</i>)</li>\n<li>Replay (<i>Static Shock</i>)</li>\n<li>Lexiac (<i>DCAU</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDuplication_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Ring of the Nine Dragons (<i>Xiaolin Showdown</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class